  {
    "id": 1013003010010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──２８３プロダクション所属、\r\n放課後クライマックスガールズの有栖川夏葉です",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "013",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "まず、今回このような機会をいただき\r\nこの場に立たせていただけたことに感謝しています",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いただいたチャンスに応えられるように……\r\n応援や期待に応えられるように",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ソロだろうとユニットだろうと、\r\n私がトップを目指すことには変わりありません",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──私、有栖川夏葉は\r\n『G.R.A.D.』で優勝します",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0566",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00087",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "060",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──有栖川夏葉、『G.R.A.D.』製作発表ステージで\r\n堂々優勝宣言……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ファン歓喜も有言実行なるか──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ネットニュースになってるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……そうね\r\n確かにそう言ったもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "013",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、まぁ、そうなんだが……\r\n発言の一部を切り取って見出しにされるとさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉のことちゃんとわかってくれているファンは\r\n喜んでくれているけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "このネットニュースで夏葉のことを知った人たちは\r\n夏葉のこと誤解してる気がして……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "記事の書き方のせいもあると思うけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………うふふ\r\n有栖川の家のことまで書いてあったものね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "『高飛車なお嬢様』\r\n『世間知らずのビッグマウス』",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……記事、全部読んだのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "仕方がないわ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そういうふうに書かれることも\r\n予想できなくはなかった",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、そういう人たちにも、\r\n本当の有栖川夏葉を知ってもらう機会でしょう？",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいの\r\n──私、誰のことも諦めないわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ちゃんと、みんなに応援される\r\n有栖川夏葉になるの",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……なれるわ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "…………\r\nそれにしても",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』に出場する子たちはみんな\r\n優勝を目指しているんじゃないのかしら",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\nああ、それはそうだろうけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そうよね？\r\nそれなのに、変よ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "目標を口にしたり、そこに向かって\r\n一生懸命に努力することってそんなにいけないのかしら",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "恥ずかしいことでも、\r\nかっこ悪いことでもないはずなのに",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！\r\n…………そう、だよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ、私がそう言えるのはアナタがいて、\r\n周りのサポートがあるからだけど",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010220,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だからこそ、言ったからには\r\n有言実行しなくちゃね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010230,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300301/1013003010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013003010240,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──ソロだろうとユニットだろうと、\r\n私がトップを目指すことには変わりないもの",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
